      "role": "user",
      "content": "that formula makes sense. but the issue is that even when we increase the safety stock, we still get these weird, sudden drops in inventory that don't match our sales data. like, something feels off with the tracking. do u think there are other variables i should be factoring into the logic to account for those kinds of sudden discrepancies?",
